   Sort Key: ft2.c1, (random())
   ->  Foreign Scan on public.ft2
         Output: c1, c2, c3, c4, c5, c6, c7, c8, random()
         Remote SQL: SELECT "C 1", c2, c3, c4, c5, c6, c7, c8 FROM "S 1"."T 1"
(6 rows)

